    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE**\n\nFour bedroomed semi-detached family residence (c. 1,432sq. ft. 133sq.m.) excluding garage. Private mature walled gardens circa 65ft. Accommodation also comprises spacious entrance hallway, with cloakroom, lounge, kitchen/family room, & downstairs w.c. \n\nLocated between Butterfield Park & Willbrook Road less than one kilometre from Rathfarnham Village, close to local parks including St. Enda's and Marlay and less than five minutes to M 50 interchange at Scholarstown. Convenient to selection of excellent primary & secondary schools, shopping facilities and public transport routes (15B, 16, 74 & S6) are close by. \n\nThere is gas fired central heating & double-glazed windows. Carpets and Curtains are included in the sale."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Porch - \nTiled Floor\n\nEntrance Hallway - 4.56m x 3.38m\nCloakroom & Understairs Storage\n\nLiving Room - 4.52m x 4.86m\nStone fireplace with timber surround\n\nFamily Room - 4.10m x 3.38m\nFireplace with solid fuel stove\n\nKitchen - 3.58m x 3.38m\nSelection of fitted presses including fridge/freezer & gas cooker, with breakfast counter, leading to...\n\nDownstairs w.c. & w.h.b. & store - \n\n\nGarage - 2.50m x 5.57m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nShower Room - 2.00m x 2.50m\nWith w.c. & w.h.b. part tiled, walk in shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.99mx 4.26m\nBuilt in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.60m x 4.26m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.10m x 3.38m\nBuilt in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.38m x 2.50m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Garage 5.57m x 2.5m with Gas Boiler</li><li> Burglar Alarm</li><li> Off Street Parking</li><li> Private Walled Gardens circa 65 ft.</li><li> Floor Area (c. 1,432sq. ft. 133sq.m.) excluding garage.</ul>"
      },
